<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sue's Crafts</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background-color: #fdf6e3;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #6b4c3b;
            font-size: 3em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: #8b6b5a;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .artwork {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 4px solid #e8a87c;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .description {
            background-color: #faf0ea;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .description h2 {
            color: #6b4c3b;
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .description p {
            color: #5a4033;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 1.1em;
        }

        .fun-fact {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border-left: 5px solid #d4896b;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .contact-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #6b4c3b;
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.3em;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 20px 0 10px 0;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .contact-btn:hover {
            background-color: #8b6b5a;
        }

        .footer {
            color: #a08473;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e8d5c9;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">

        <!-- Header -->
        <h1>🧶 Welcome to Sue's Crafts!</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">✨ Handmade with love, one stitch at a time ✨</p>

        <!-- Image -->
        <img class="artwork" src="images/IMG_20211208_133409_049.webp" alt="Sue's crochet dolls">

        <!-- Description -->
        <div class="description">
            <h2>🌸 About This Piece</h2>
            <p>
                This adorable crochet creation features two sweet little dolls, 
                lovingly handcrafted with care and attention to every detail. 
                Their smiling faces and cozy outfits make them the perfect 
                companions for cuddles and playtime!
            </p>
            <div class="fun-fact">
                💕 Did you know? These two best friends took over 15 hours to crochet! 
                Each stitch was made with love, and their little outfits are 
                completely removable for dress-up fun! 🧵
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Contact Button -->
        <a class="contact-btn" href="mailto:suesjeans@gmail.com">
            📧 Contact Us
        </a>
        <p style="color: #8b6b5a; font-size: 0.95em;">
            Have questions or want to commission a custom piece?<br>
            We'd love to hear from you!
        </p>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>© 2026 Sue's Crafts | Handcrafted with ❤️</p>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
